# legs/adult/pose/std: the adult legs in trousers and boots in the postures (POSES-B, P2b wave 2), shared by the man and
# the woman like the slice's legs/adult/loco/std (regions: T thigh, K knee, S shin, B boot, O sole). Keys:
#   cross  cross-legged on the floor or a cushion (SitFloor, its eat and drink, Beg): the hips 2 rows over the floor
#          (seatFit2's floor seats; the clip's bob 8), the knees out past the hips, the shins folded in before the lap
#          with the boots tucked toe to toe (front: drawn over the hem, the lap's front edge)
#   kneel  on the left knee, the right foot planted (Kneel, Downed): the hips 5 rows over the floor (bob 5); facing right
#          the planted leg is the near one, facing left the kneeling one
#   ride   astride (Ride): the hips on the saddle 8 rows over the stirrups' soles (bob 2), the thighs out over the barrel,
#          the knees bent, the boots down in the stirrups; the `hip` mark is the point the view puts on the saddle
# Chunky like the slice (the owner's rule): every leg keeps the standing leg's 5 px trouser block and 7 px boot.
use person
body adult
role legs std
layer legs
anchor pivot
keys legs

# ============================================================ cross
view D key cross origin 11 3 layer hangFront
